WEBVTT

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:06.650
<b>GUNDAM
VICTORY
MOBILE SUIT</b>

00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:12.610
The furious rain, Makes my heart shake
hageshii ame ga, kokoro wo yuruwaseru

00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:15.820
Like it did on that day
Ano hi no youni

00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:22.910
But I just ran through, In my dream I had till yesterday
Tada hashirinuketa, kinou made no MY DREAM

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:26.710
...I still believe
...shinjiteiru no sa

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:34.470
I'm willing to fight, An endless defense
Owari no nai, defense demo ii yo

00:00:35.090 --> 00:00:42.350
As long as you, Keep on gazing at me
Kimi ga boku wo, mitsumetsuzukete kureru nara

00:00:42.730 --> 00:00:45.270
STAND UP TO THE VICTORY!

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:50.980
Turn to face all the mornings ahead, And someday
Ikutsumono asa wo mukae, Itsuka kitto

00:00:52.070 --> 00:00:53.860
Try to seize them
tsukande miseru

00:00:53.990 --> 00:00:56.450
STAND UP TO THE VICTORY!

00:00:56.780 --> 00:01:02.120
Even if nothing, Lies on the other side
Sono mukougawa ni, nanimonakutemo

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:06.040
It doesn't matter to me
kamawanai kara

00:01:06.210 --> 00:01:14.050
...Just as long as I can embrace, Your gentle, irreplaceable smile!
Kakegae no nai, kimi no yasashii egao daite

00:01:31.300 --> 00:01:32.160
The fleet...

00:01:32.200 --> 00:01:33.800
...gathered here is...
Earth Federation Ireland Area Forces

00:01:33.830 --> 00:01:36.500
...the strongest in the Zanscare Empire!
Earth Federation Ireland Area Forces
Old-style Battleship "Reineforce"

00:01:36.900 --> 00:01:39.930
And I decree it the Mutterma Sugan Fleet!

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:43.160
Mutterma Fleet! Mutterma Fleet!

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:44.760
If they can turn citizens into soldiers...

00:01:44.800 --> 00:01:45.800
...with the threat of the guillotine,
The mightiest fleet in the Zanscare Empire has been assembled...

00:01:45.800 --> 00:01:45.830
The mightiest fleet in the Zanscare Empire has been assembled...

00:01:45.830 --> 00:01:47.300
... they can do anything.

00:01:47.460 --> 00:01:49.300
They certainly have confidence...
...to strike the united fleet at Side 2!

00:01:49.300 --> 00:01:51.900
...if they're making propaganda broadcasts like this.

00:01:53.100 --> 00:01:54.030
Solar Battery - "Hiland"

00:01:54.030 --> 00:01:57.000
The Hiland.

00:01:57.160 --> 00:02:00.660
A giant solar battery for sending electricity to Earth.

00:02:00.700 --> 00:02:02.630
Currently not in use.

00:02:02.900 --> 00:02:05.560
Üso and the others have met up with...

00:02:05.600 --> 00:02:07.960
...the families currently living on the Hiland.
Hiland's Wharf Block

00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:08.000
Hiland's Wharf Block

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:09.630
To spread the heart of...

00:02:09.660 --> 00:02:11.630
...the Zanscare Empire's Queen Maria,

00:02:11.660 --> 00:02:14.560
we regretfully must employ force!

00:02:15.060 --> 00:02:18.160
The Zanscare forces are confident, huh?
Queen Maria Pure Armonia is saddened by the fighting.

00:02:18.160 --> 00:02:18.200
Queen Maria Pure Armonia is saddened by the fighting.

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:20.430
But there are many, many more who...

00:02:20.460 --> 00:02:22.260
...oppose the guillotines.
And so, to quiet our queen's heart,

00:02:22.260 --> 00:02:22.300
And so, to quiet our queen's heart,

00:02:22.300 --> 00:02:23.560
I guess.

00:02:23.830 --> 00:02:26.860
we must send the fleet forth!

00:02:28.960 --> 00:02:32.100
QUEEN OF THE EMPIRE

00:02:32.100 --> 00:02:34.730
"Queen of the Empire".

00:02:34.730 --> 00:02:34.760
QUEEN OF THE EMPIRE

00:02:38.530 --> 00:02:39.360
The Reineforce...

00:02:39.400 --> 00:02:40.530
Reineforce
...is currently en route...

00:02:40.530 --> 00:02:40.560
Reineforce

00:02:40.560 --> 00:02:44.000
...towards the Hiland in geosynchronous orbit.
Hiland
Reineforce

00:02:45.200 --> 00:02:47.800
Far above them, in front of the moon,

00:02:47.830 --> 00:02:51.530
are two areas where space colonies are gathered.

00:02:52.260 --> 00:02:54.760
Side 1 and Side 2.

00:02:54.800 --> 00:02:56.300
Zanscare Empire Side 2

00:02:56.300 --> 00:02:58.330
The Zanscare Empire homeland...

00:02:58.360 --> 00:03:02.760
...is the colonies located furthest from the moon.

00:03:03.600 --> 00:03:07.800
If some cannot understand the ideals of our Zanscare Empire's Mariaism...

00:03:08.360 --> 00:03:11.260
...and are jealous of our empire's successes, and gather a fleet to attack us,
Battleship - Amalthea-class

00:03:11.260 --> 00:03:13.800
Cruiser - Callisto-class

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:18.200
Zanscare Imperial Forces - Mutterma Fleet
then we, too, must rise!

00:03:18.230 --> 00:03:21.130
And we must take this opportunity to spread...

00:03:21.160 --> 00:03:22.900
Assault Craft - Sinope
...the heart of our mother,

00:03:22.900 --> 00:03:24.660
Queen Maria,
General Purpose Space MS - Zoloat

00:03:24.660 --> 00:03:24.700
General Purpose Space MS - Zoloat
Assault Craft - Sinope

00:03:24.700 --> 00:03:26.460
to the people...

00:03:26.500 --> 00:03:27.830
...of the entire world!

00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:34.060
Her Majesty the Queen will personally address the troops...

00:03:34.100 --> 00:03:35.300
...after General...
Zanscare Prime Minister

00:03:35.330 --> 00:03:38.160
...Mutterma Sugan, to raise morale.

00:03:38.930 --> 00:03:45.360
Before that, Lt. Commander Duker Iq has a report for me, does he not?

00:03:45.760 --> 00:03:46.560
Yes.

00:03:46.860 --> 00:03:49.860
I am honored that you have granted me this audience,

00:03:49.900 --> 00:03:53.700
even after our continual failures while patrolling on Earth.
Lieutenant Commander Duker Iq

00:03:53.930 --> 00:03:55.200
Queen of the Zanscare Empire

00:03:55.200 --> 00:03:58.330
It is only natural for the one who proposed...
Maria Pure Armonia
Queen of the Zanscare Empire

00:03:58.360 --> 00:03:59.660
...the Motorad vessel.

00:03:59.700 --> 00:04:01.500
You are too generous.

00:04:01.960 --> 00:04:03.200
The Motorad battleships...

00:04:03.230 --> 00:04:06.700
...and heavy cruisers were the brainchild of Lord Kagatie.
Battleship - Motorad-class

00:04:06.730 --> 00:04:10.960
He simply allowed me to offer some technical ideas.

00:04:15.500 --> 00:04:19.560
This special design will fill the enemy with fear,

00:04:19.600 --> 00:04:23.260
allowing us to force their surrender without fighting.

00:04:23.460 --> 00:04:26.460
Avoiding combat would be desirable.

00:04:27.460 --> 00:04:31.900
I've no love for the guillotine or the battles we've fought so far.

00:04:31.930 --> 00:04:36.660
Also, if you knew of the difficult battles fought by your brother Lord Cronicle,

00:04:36.700 --> 00:04:39.960
you'd understand the need for this ship.

00:04:40.260 --> 00:04:41.460
I'd like to hear of that.

00:04:41.500 --> 00:04:42.660
Yes, my queen.

00:04:42.700 --> 00:04:47.930
The Yellow Jackets advanced into Largaine in central Europe.

00:04:48.130 --> 00:04:52.160
There, Lt. Cronicle Asher, while conducting...

00:04:52.200 --> 00:04:57.000
...an Earthside test flight of the Shokew mobile suit from Largaine to Uwig,

00:04:57.030 --> 00:04:58.860
encountered a machine from the rebels...

00:04:58.900 --> 00:05:00.660
...known as the League Militaire.
Kasarelia

00:05:00.660 --> 00:05:00.700
Kasarelia

00:05:00.700 --> 00:05:02.660
When he attempted to capture it,

00:05:03.360 --> 00:05:05.460
the situation took a dramatic turn.
Test Mobile Suit - Shokew

00:05:05.460 --> 00:05:05.500
Test Mobile Suit - Shokew

00:05:05.500 --> 00:05:08.000
Pilot - Cronicle Asher

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:08.460
Test Mobile Suit - Shokew

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:14.400
Garry, box him in!

00:05:43.100 --> 00:05:45.360
Time to try a live fire test.

00:05:47.200 --> 00:06:08.530
What?!

00:06:09.230 --> 00:06:10.530
What the hell is...

00:06:17.500 --> 00:06:18.730
Who are you?!

00:06:18.760 --> 00:06:20.560
You knew someone was riding on this thing!

00:06:20.600 --> 00:06:22.130
Why is the Zanscare army here?!

00:06:22.160 --> 00:06:23.530
You're one to talk!

00:06:23.560 --> 00:06:24.830
What are you even doing here?!

00:06:24.860 --> 00:06:26.030
Why, you little...

00:06:30.260 --> 00:06:31.960
Go back to space!

00:06:32.230 --> 00:06:34.160
You dare defy us?!

00:06:35.730 --> 00:06:37.400
You people!

00:06:40.230 --> 00:06:41.900
Why, you! Fall!

00:06:41.930 --> 00:06:44.300
Why, you! You... You...

00:06:44.330 --> 00:06:45.560
Fall!

00:07:09.260 --> 00:07:11.500
How humiliating.

00:07:11.600 --> 00:07:15.860
I never expected the League Militaire would attack me with a paraglider!

00:07:15.900 --> 00:07:17.500
I have to steal it back!

00:07:17.800 --> 00:07:20.260
The cause of the lieutenant's failure...

00:07:20.300 --> 00:07:23.530
...was that his body had not yet adjusted to Earth's gravity.

00:07:23.560 --> 00:07:28.400
Despite this, we stuck to our original strategy...

00:07:28.430 --> 00:07:31.060
...and Uwig fell into our hands.

00:07:31.730 --> 00:07:34.230
Uwig was a special city, for those...

00:07:34.260 --> 00:07:37.900
...allowed by the Federation...
Uwig Special Zone

00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:39.660
...to live on Earth.

00:07:56.500 --> 00:08:00.430
Why was it necessary to burn all of Uwig?

00:08:00.460 --> 00:08:03.360
The League Militaire's secret underground factory...

00:08:03.400 --> 00:08:07.430
...was located in the pre-UC subway facilities.

00:08:07.530 --> 00:08:09.600
It was an unavoidable decision.

00:08:17.530 --> 00:08:22.330
However, as we allowed the civilians to flee the city first,

00:08:22.600 --> 00:08:26.560
I'm confident the human losses were minimized.

00:08:26.600 --> 00:08:27.730
You're certain?

00:08:27.760 --> 00:08:28.530
Yes!

00:08:28.630 --> 00:08:32.760
And my brother Cronicle was rescued immediately afterward?

00:08:33.060 --> 00:08:38.530
Yes, in a place called Kasarelia, northwest of Uwig.

00:08:38.630 --> 00:08:42.130
While searching for rebel elements in the vicinity,

00:08:42.230 --> 00:08:45.230
the lieutenant made contact with the locals.

00:08:49.730 --> 00:08:51.860
Wait! You, girl! Stop!

00:08:53.500 --> 00:08:55.300
Flanders, stop.

00:08:55.660 --> 00:08:57.730
Miss, I have one question to ask.

00:08:57.760 --> 00:08:59.000
Yes?

00:09:01.700 --> 00:09:04.860
Have you seen any suspicious people around here?

00:09:06.300 --> 00:09:08.460
Sabat, it's too soon!

00:09:23.860 --> 00:09:26.930
Commander Sabat! The Shokew has appeared!

00:09:32.900 --> 00:09:35.400
This is Cronicle! I'm docking with the Boots!

00:09:41.060 --> 00:09:44.400
General Purpose Ground MS - Zolo

00:09:50.230 --> 00:09:52.000
Its movements are improving.

00:10:01.400 --> 00:10:03.260
Even something that big...

00:10:07.700 --> 00:10:10.530
Sabat, where are you? Commander Sabat!

00:10:15.300 --> 00:10:18.400
The Shokew! Is it too much for Sabat alone?

00:10:37.100 --> 00:10:38.130
I did it...

00:10:41.600 --> 00:10:45.760
It just hit the cockpit?! Who's piloting the Shokew?!

00:10:53.000 --> 00:10:55.660
I'm taking my test unit back!

00:10:58.530 --> 00:11:01.330
The next shot will be aimed at the cockpit, Pilot!

00:11:05.330 --> 00:11:07.160
Beam shield, deploy!

00:11:13.930 --> 00:11:15.330
The escape pod?!

00:11:27.500 --> 00:11:30.660
Because Lt. Cronicle recovered the Shokew unit,

00:11:30.700 --> 00:11:33.860
we learned of the problems in the body frame,

00:11:33.930 --> 00:11:38.100
which will be of great use to our future mobile suit development.

00:11:39.330 --> 00:11:43.330
And Cronicle has grown as a pilot, as well.

00:11:56.300 --> 00:11:59.860
Afterward, thanks to the lieutenant's efforts,

00:12:00.100 --> 00:12:02.930
we discovered the League Militaire's...

00:12:02.960 --> 00:12:07.230
...largest underground factory on the outskirts of Kolin, to the east of Uwig.

00:12:07.700 --> 00:12:09.830
Another large truck!

00:12:20.400 --> 00:12:23.130
Isn't there any trace of the factory in your readings?

00:12:23.900 --> 00:12:24.930
That's...

00:12:28.230 --> 00:12:29.930
Where did that come from?!

00:12:33.430 --> 00:12:34.630
Out of ammo?

00:12:40.200 --> 00:12:41.430
You stubborn little...

00:12:41.460 --> 00:12:42.260
What?!

00:12:44.730 --> 00:12:48.560
They're targeting my Boots because they're flying too low?

00:12:57.130 --> 00:12:59.900
While I was docking, that little fighter...

00:13:04.860 --> 00:13:07.360
Got it! Now for the remaining segment!

00:13:24.900 --> 00:13:27.900
Dammit! While I was distracted by the ground fire, he...

00:13:29.230 --> 00:13:31.300
A white mobile suit?!

00:14:04.930 --> 00:14:07.430
He destroyed my sensors!

00:14:12.900 --> 00:14:17.600
The lieutenant was the first in our military to engage the white mobile suit.

00:14:17.630 --> 00:14:22.430
I'm told that that mobile suit is piloted by a civilian boy.

00:14:22.500 --> 00:14:23.900
Is this true?

00:14:24.400 --> 00:14:30.160
The rebels are a group of deviants who think nothing of using children!

00:14:30.200 --> 00:14:33.900
The various space colonies all desire independence,

00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:36.460
and have begun to fight amongst themselves.

00:14:36.500 --> 00:14:39.630
We face a new era of warring states in space.

00:14:40.560 --> 00:14:45.930
What I desire is to quell this chaos and bring order.

00:14:46.300 --> 00:14:47.730
As you say.

00:14:47.760 --> 00:14:52.000
However, the Earth Federation Forces, who cannot understand...

00:14:52.030 --> 00:14:54.600
...the warmth of Mariaism, have done a terrible thing.

00:14:54.630 --> 00:14:55.930
A terrible thing?

00:14:55.960 --> 00:14:56.860
Yes!

00:14:56.960 --> 00:14:59.900
I saw it with my own eyes.

00:15:00.130 --> 00:15:03.000
At the old Bechyne airport,

00:15:03.030 --> 00:15:06.360
the rebel League Militaire and the Federation Forces joined up.

00:15:06.430 --> 00:15:09.230
League Militaire Camion Unit

00:15:11.900 --> 00:15:14.460
And the Federation transport plane there...

00:15:14.500 --> 00:15:17.830
...bore the markings of the Public Corporation of Space Transport!

00:15:17.860 --> 00:15:19.360
That's strange.

00:15:19.400 --> 00:15:21.730
The corporation is charged with transporting...

00:15:21.760 --> 00:15:25.430
...the possessions of those still on Earth into space.

00:15:25.460 --> 00:15:27.400
Surely they'd maintain neutrality.

00:15:27.660 --> 00:15:31.030
They wouldn't think of defying our empire, would they?

00:15:31.060 --> 00:15:33.260
It means we've been betrayed!

00:15:33.300 --> 00:15:36.100
With my large-scale combat bike, the Galicson,

00:15:36.130 --> 00:15:38.600
which is a prototype for the Motorad,

00:15:38.630 --> 00:15:41.430
I was able to gather basic data.

00:15:45.960 --> 00:15:48.460
Gattarl Team
Giant Motorbike - Galicson

00:16:00.900 --> 00:16:04.100
They've gathered new models of mobile suits here?

00:16:05.260 --> 00:16:07.560
They have more of the white ones, now!

00:16:44.830 --> 00:16:46.860
There are two transports?!

00:17:34.030 --> 00:17:38.100
They fought like professional soldiers.

00:17:38.130 --> 00:17:40.660
Or, perhaps, even better.

00:17:40.900 --> 00:17:42.830
That name, "League Militaire"...

00:17:42.860 --> 00:17:46.500
It means "holy military alliance," does it not?

00:17:47.760 --> 00:17:51.460
What is clear is that they stand against Mariaism!

00:17:51.760 --> 00:17:57.730
That is why they used the Arti Gibraltar relay station to get into space.

00:17:58.400 --> 00:18:01.600
Arti Gibraltar

00:18:03.130 --> 00:18:08.760
Arti Gibraltar is the European launch base for the PCST.

00:18:09.700 --> 00:18:13.160
It is a facility for transporting the possessions...

00:18:13.500 --> 00:18:16.360
...of those on Earth who emigrate into space.

00:18:22.430 --> 00:18:25.300
Lt. Cronicle went to Arti Gibraltar...

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:28.930
...to ensure that they maintain their absolute neutrality,

00:18:29.330 --> 00:18:31.930
along with Commander Fuala Griffon.

00:18:31.960 --> 00:18:33.830
However, of all the things that could have happened...

00:18:33.860 --> 00:18:35.430
Mobile suits?!

00:18:42.730 --> 00:18:45.730
This fact couldn't be explained away,

00:18:45.760 --> 00:18:48.600
and proved that the corporation had betrayed us.

00:18:48.930 --> 00:18:55.660
The League Militaire attacked Commander Fuala and Lt. Cronicle at Arti Gibraltar.

00:19:01.530 --> 00:19:05.300
Commander Fuala Griffon felt that if they were not eliminated,

00:19:05.330 --> 00:19:08.660
she could not protect the neutrality of Arti Gibraltar,

00:19:08.700 --> 00:19:11.400
and desperately tried to convince their officials to act.

00:19:11.430 --> 00:19:15.730
She and her team apparently took pains to avoid destroying the facilities.

00:19:15.930 --> 00:19:18.930
The even more unforgivable violation...

00:19:18.960 --> 00:19:23.300
...was that the corporation launched the white mobile suit into space!

00:19:23.600 --> 00:19:25.930
With a corporation shuttle?

00:19:26.860 --> 00:19:30.830
The lieutenant grabbed on to a shuttle to confirm it.

00:19:30.860 --> 00:19:33.800
It was how he was able to return to space.

00:19:47.000 --> 00:19:49.500
Our forces are superior in space!

00:19:49.630 --> 00:19:52.000
And with this strength, we shall spread Mariaism...

00:19:52.030 --> 00:19:54.700
...and envelop even the people of Earth!

00:19:56.130 --> 00:19:58.530
The flight that followed after the one the lieutenant took...

00:19:58.560 --> 00:20:01.430
...launched the white mobile suit into space.

00:20:02.600 --> 00:20:07.730
I'm troubled about this boy who pilots the white mobile suit.

00:20:07.760 --> 00:20:08.960
So am I.

00:20:09.000 --> 00:20:12.200
The boy can't be left to these deviants!

00:20:12.800 --> 00:20:15.730
The fact is that the Federation and the Corporation have...

00:20:15.760 --> 00:20:18.300
...violated international law to oppose us.

00:20:19.530 --> 00:20:22.130
Do you intend to overlook it?

00:20:35.730 --> 00:20:36.460
Zanscare!

00:20:36.500 --> 00:20:39.430
General Mutterma Sugan Maria! Zanscare!

00:20:39.460 --> 00:20:40.560
Maria!

00:20:51.760 --> 00:20:53.860
Officers and enlisted men of Zanscare.

00:20:53.900 --> 00:20:57.000
Especially those who are stained with machine oil...

00:20:57.030 --> 00:21:00.200
...and you who tremble in your tiny cockpits.

00:21:00.330 --> 00:21:02.760
You are the ones that I love.

00:21:03.260 --> 00:21:05.760
I will do all that I can...

00:21:06.000 --> 00:21:08.860
...to assure that you have a warm place to return to...

00:21:09.200 --> 00:21:11.000
...once the fighting is done.

00:21:11.360 --> 00:21:16.830
All that I ask is that you pledge to me your lives...

00:21:16.860 --> 00:21:20.500
...until the great love of Zanscare envelops the world.

00:21:22.330 --> 00:21:25.160
The word is given for the fleet to sally forth!

00:21:25.400 --> 00:21:25.430
The Queen of the Zanscare Empire talks about love, but...

00:21:25.430 --> 00:21:27.130
All ships, launch!

00:21:27.130 --> 00:21:29.130
The Queen of the Zanscare Empire talks about love, but...

00:21:30.130 --> 00:21:32.430
That's our enemy?

00:21:32.730 --> 00:21:36.460
Well, well, they've painted us as monsters.

00:21:36.960 --> 00:21:38.830
They sure have.

00:21:38.860 --> 00:21:41.460
All right, then! Full speed ahead!

00:22:24.060 --> 00:22:29.530
Piercing the sky, Blue lightning
sora wo tsukisasu aoi inazuma

00:22:29.530 --> 00:22:35.320
Staining the earth, With the shadow of greed
daichi o someteku, yokubou no kage

00:22:36.370 --> 00:22:41.460
Once again, when the nightmare, Envelops the Earth
futatabi akumu ga, sekai wo tsutsumu toki

00:22:41.460 --> 00:22:46.790
You hear voices crying out "S.O.S."
"SOS" wo sakebu koe ga kikoeru...

00:22:48.630 --> 00:22:54.130
Let proud hope fill your heart
hokoritakaki kibou wo mune ni

00:22:54.720 --> 00:23:03.100
And stand up! Say a prayer for peace!!
tachiagare! heiwa no inori komete!

00:23:04.100 --> 00:23:05.100
WINNERS FOREVER!

00:23:06.100 --> 00:23:08.980
In every age
itsuno jidai mo

00:23:08.980 --> 00:23:14.570
...People take risks for freedom
hito wa jiyuu wo kakete

00:23:15.000 --> 00:23:17.000
WINNERS FOREVER!

00:23:18.330 --> 00:23:21.240
The battle goes on
tatakai tsuzukeru

00:23:21.240 --> 00:23:25.920
Fighting all alone in solitude
kodoku na made ni hitori...

00:23:34.130 --> 00:23:37.830
"If I meet Mr. Jinn Jahannam, I'll learn about my parents!"

00:23:38.560 --> 00:23:40.900
Thinking that, Üso sets out into battle.

00:23:41.560 --> 00:23:44.400
On a battlefield where friend and foe are jumbled together,

00:23:44.430 --> 00:23:46.160
Üso knows fear,

00:23:46.600 --> 00:23:50.100
and we're thrown into space!

00:23:51.400 --> 00:23:54.060
Next time, on Mobile Suit Victory Gundam:

00:23:54.100 --> 00:23:54.500
"Space Fleet Battle".

00:23:54.500 --> 00:23:57.230
Next Episode SPACE FLEET BATTLE

00:23:57.230 --> 00:23:58.500
Please watch it!
